<title>UK: Prowting Plc H1 pretax profit drops.</title>
<headline>Prowting Plc H1 pretax profit drops.</headline>
<text>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.6		    vs 3.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.9		    vs 1.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.2		    vs 4.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   59.2		   vs 50.4</p>
<p> Operating profit	 3.4		    vs 5.7</p>
<p> Interest payable	 1.4		    vs 1.8</p>
<p> Tax			  0.7		    vs 1.2</p>
<p> Net taxed		  1.6		    vs 2.9</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan. 13, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  Nov. 26</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Nov. 18</p>
<p>NOTE: Prowting Plc is a housing development company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
